WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.140
Colour attracts attention, but too many colours confuse.

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:09.580
Use a small palette: one main colour, one accent, and neutrals.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.082
Give text strong contrast with its background.

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:16.942
Remember that colours carry meaning, like red for urgency.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:21.197
And check your colours on a phone, outdoors in bright light.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:31.247
Before you move on, check: Pick a main colour, an accent and neutrals. Check text contrast. Test the colours on a phone outdoors.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.314
In the next lesson: Typography.
